WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.940
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.750
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.150
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:12.450
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.400
That's the accelerator screamin', as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.960
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew, in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.680
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.420
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.330
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.400
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:01.440
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.530
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:13.310
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.650
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:25.660
...the way you avoided me, usin' that naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:28.960
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:37.740
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:41.180
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:05.190
Well, do you believe it or not?
Madoka saw a UFO.

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:29.660
It is not the past or the future, much less the present.

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:34.170
The traveling makes the
bluish cold air of autumn leap.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:38.680
The adventure brightens
his green eyes to the sky.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:43.690
And the dream of his eyes roars like a voice of birth!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.020
It was right after
we were done with finals...

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:54.180
...just as we were looking forward to the summer vacation.

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:56.460
It all happened so suddenly.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.600
Sorry about this... making you come all the way to ABCB...

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:03.930
No prob... The film was jammed, that's all it was.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.680
Even you could've fixed it yourself...

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:09.570
What's wrong, Ayukawa?

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:10.590
Look!

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.960
Huh?
Look!

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:19.160
Oh! The c... c...camera!

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:31.240
You saw it, didn't you?!

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:34.210
Yeah...
You saw it, didn't you?!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.990
Dad! I got it!

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:41.250
Develop the film! I got a UFO on...

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:03.130
UFO...?!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.930
Will you please let me get some sleep?!

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:18.960
I go on location first thing tomorrow, you know!

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:24.690
Kurumi! Kurumi! Manami! Kurumi!

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:31.580
Isn't this awesome, Oniichan?
It's the "Ultra SFX 3D Special!"

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:34.820
Let's all have the
"Space Experience" together!

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:37.080
Oh, no, let's not!

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:39.110
Geez!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:05.070
Did you get it on film?

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:07.130
Y... Yeah...
Did you get it on film?

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:07.210
Did you get it on film?

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.270
Oh! It came out real good!

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:15.020
K...Kinda...

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.150
Er, I... listen...

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:18.440
Huh?
Er, I... listen...

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:18.530
Er, I... listen...

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:22.260
Why don't we...
just between the two of us...

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:25.400
...you know... why don't we
keep it a s... secr...

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.530
...keep it a secret?

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:28.790
What?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:30.810
Y... You know...

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:35.850
...I was thinking that it might be...
nice that way...

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.500
Just between the two of us?

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.470
Yeah.
Just between the two of us?

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:49.840
You're right. Sure.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:57.050
Well then!

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:02.500
There was no way...
I could tell Ayukawa that...

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.310
...the "UFO" was flown by Kurumi.

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:08.510
But... I feel like I'm
deceiving her so much that...

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.560
...it's making me anxious.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:16.070
Sempai! What're you doing?

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:17.660
Hikaru!
Sempai! What're you doing?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:17.750
Sempai! What're you doing?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.090
Why, it's a UFO! What happened?! You saw it?!

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:21.480
It's... It's not what you think!

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.780
You saw it for real?!
It's... It's not what you think!

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:29.430
A UFO?! Yeah. There's a rumor going around that someone saw a UFO!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:33.770
I have no idea... I do! Want me to show it to you? The UFO?

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:35.460
What?!

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:38.220
What?!
What?!

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:38.310
What?!

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:41.170
I'm just kidding! You shouldn't take me so seriously!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.730
Still... Are you two in
the Newspaper Club? I had no idea.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.150
Er... Yeah!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.870
Our agile camerawork!

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:50.030
Our high-energy curiosity!
Our agile camerawork!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:50.120
Our agile camerawork!

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:53.660
And the shameless resolve to
barge into other people's business!

00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:58.260
With these three talents in harmony, we make excellent reporters!

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.190
Or, it could be you're just perverts, MAYBE!

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:02.130
Two people, one on camera, one behind it...

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:05.100
It could make one boy's
love blossom, MAYBE!

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:08.540
News! News! Some MAJOR News!

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:12.060
What?! You say you saw the lovely li'l UFO?!

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:20.090
From Hikaru's mouth...
the rumor instantly spread everywhere...

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:22.750
Hey, have you heard?
What happened?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:25.990
Have you heard? Kasuga and Ayukawa had an encounter with a UFO!

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:28.120
What?! Is that for real?!

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:33.390
What?! Kasuga and Ayukawa flew around in a UFO?!

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:34.380
No way!

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:37.400
Ayukawa went out on a date with an alien?!

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.460
I can't believe it!

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:42.580
Well? Is that for real?

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:45.240
Well?! Did the story we heard really happen?!

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:48.300
Is it true that you dated an alien?!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:56.150
And? You DID take the pictures, didn't you?!

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:57.950
W...Well, no...

00:08:57.950 --> 00:08:58.710
Hey, man!

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.340
Tell us the truth!
Hey, man!

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:00.420
Hey, man!

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:02.570
W...Well...

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:05.930
Look, Kasuga, you DID see it, right?

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:10.330
Er... At... At first, I wondered if it was a UFO or something...

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.370
"Or something?!"

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:13.720
...I was wondering, but...

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:16.020
B...But what?!
...I was wondering, but...

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:16.100
...I was wondering, but...

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:20.110
A UFO...

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.100
...it wasn't.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:23.590
It wasn't?!
...it wasn't.

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:23.680
...it wasn't.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:28.250
Uh-huh. I guess I made
a mistake or something...

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.470
You sure about that?!

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:31.530
Y...Yes.
You sure about that?!

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:35.620
Gee! It was a bogus story?!

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:38.680
What...?! It was made up?!

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:44.470
There was no way...
that I could tell the truth.

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:47.370
I had to come up with a cover story.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:51.790
Who knew that it would result in
something so awful...?

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.370
Can you believe that?!

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:55.940
Just when you thought she'd calmed down,
she's making up stories!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:10:00.400
It's no wonder, she's the
"Alien of Homeroom 3-A" to begin with!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.720
Still, she didn't have to use a UFO as the topic, y'know!

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:07.820
Maybe she's the sort that craves attention!

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:08.950
Right!

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:11.310
Oh! Look!
Right!

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:33.190
Ayukawa... I'm sorry...

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:50.900
Ayukawa... I need to, er...
apologize to you!

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:53.600
Er... I, er... Wh...What happened was that...

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.950
A... Ayukawa...

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:02.980
Ushiko!

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:04.550
Umao!

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:07.250
Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:10.310
And, wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.270
Come on, Madoka!
Something is wrong with you!

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:24.060
Why did you say you saw a UFO, when you know they don't exist!

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:26.850
You don't think they exist? UFOs, that is?

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:36.940
I saw what I saw.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:40.090
But, we're talking about a UFO! You've got to be kidding!

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.820
You idiot! You don't know what you're talking about, Yuusaku!

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:47.150
Wh... H... Hikaru!

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:49.460
But, it's some absurd UFO we're talking about...

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:53.630
What?! Yuusaku, you don't believe in
the existence of UFOs?!

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:54.480
Huh?!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:54.850
And, you claim to be a Newtype?!
"Newtype:" the new generation, as opposed to old fogeys & parents.

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:56.990
"Newtype:" the new generation, as opposed to old fogeys & parents.
And, you claim to be a Newtype?!

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:58.350
N... Newtype?!

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:01.320
Besides, Madoka would never lie!

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.690
Then, Kasuga must've...

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:07.650
Huh?! W...Well, that's, er...

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:12.130
M... Madoka...?!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:15.770
Sempai...

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:18.070
Huh... What is it?

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:20.350
Er... Umm...

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:22.050
The UFO...

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:23.140
The UFO?
The UFO...

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:23.220
The UFO...

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:27.990
...y... you didn't see it, did you?

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:28.690
Did you...?

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:30.780
Oh...
Did you...?

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:30.830
Did you...?

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:31.750
Nope.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:32.350
O... Of course not!
Nope.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:34.850
O... Of course not!

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:37.840
That's what I thought!

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:41.190
There's no such things as UFOs, right!

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:51.470
There's no way that
Darling would lie either...

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:58.180
C'mon, UFO! Are you there or not?!
Answer me!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.230
You swear that you didn't see a UFO?!

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:03.580
Y...Yeah...

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:08.150
If you don't tell the truth,
then this is what you're gonna get!

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:16.460
Do you... know of a human race
called "Newtypes?"

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:22.290
Oh, you don't, eh? Fine.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.320
I want to...

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:32.590
...I really want to tell exactly what happened!

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:33.810
But...

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:46.180
We've got to capture the UFO
on film ourselves, to help them out!

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.080
But, I doubt that it'll be that easy...

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:51.450
"If you think it'll happen, it will...
If you don't, it won't...", as the saying goes!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:54.810
Huh? But, in this case...

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:58.740
Where's your spirit?!
We'll capture the UFO with our spirit!

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:04.390
I don't care what you say! We can't reveal the truth!

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:05.620
But...

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:06.220
But me no buts!
But...

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:08.650
But me no buts!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.460
There!

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:16.770
Don't you care what happens to Ayukawa?!

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.810
Don't you care how much
your Dad loves this town?!

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:22.570
I do too!

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:28.740
What's so hard about claiming
you didn't see something you saw?!

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:32.980
Everyone's different, don't you know?!

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:40.720
Using the Power inside the house...

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:44.490
...is allowed, isn't it?

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:06.660
Madoka! Haven't seen you around for a while.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:07.550
Oh...

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:09.950
Things are kinda lame
without you around, y'know...

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:14.020
No thanks.

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.620
Huh?
No thanks.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.370
Madoka! What's the matter?!

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:38.680
A straw hat, eh...

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:52.670
Get lots of exercise,
take care not to have any accidents...

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:55.710
...and make your summer vacation a meaningful experience.

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:58.680
It's the last day of the first Semester.

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:02.900
Ayukawa hasn't... shown up.

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:19.270
Looks like we've done
something awful to Madoka, huh?

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.340
I wonder if she's not over it...

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:23.950
Well, maybe we should
make a ton of UFOs fly around!

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:27.260
Are you nuts?! This is all your fault!

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:30.610
But... It was just for fun, that's all!

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:32.040
Kurumi, stop that!

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:32.740
But! But! But! But! B... Huh?
Kurumi, stop that!

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:34.440
But! But! But! But! B... Huh?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.110
Oniichan?!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.320
Ayukawa!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:34.290
All right! Let's step on it! Okutama or bust!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.340
Ayukawa!

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:48.140
Ayukawa!

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:54.830
UFO, you said?
Haven't heard anything about it.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:57.890
Oh, c'mon, you can do better than that!

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:01.220
Master! I'm borrowing your bicycle!

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.820
What happened, Kasuga?
Master! I'm borrowing your bicycle!

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:02.900
Master! I'm borrowing your bicycle!

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:05.960
Did you come across
a good story or something?!

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.730
What... What was that all about?

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:16.790
If you have to worry about what others think...

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:19.360
...and you have to claim
you didn't see what you saw...

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.650
...and if that's what you have to do in order to be an adult...

00:18:21.650 --> 00:18:23.090
...then I...

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:26.450
...then I don't ever want to become one!

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.670
Even if it becomes known that
my family has Paranormal Powers...

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.670
...I couldn't care less!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.740
So what if the UFO was just
something that Kurumi levitated?

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.400
The fact is that I saw it...

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:39.430
...together with Ayukawa!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.970
Goddammit!

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:32.740
I'll be damned!

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:38.670
Well, Madoka? Didn't that feel great?

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:40.660
Huh? Yeah...

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:43.330
If you want, you can keep the helmet.

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:44.690
Shit happens, you know...
If you want, you can keep the helmet.

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:44.770
If you want, you can keep the helmet.

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:47.680
In this world, too many people
don't give a damn about others...

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:49.600
Right, Madoka?

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.940
Let's get going soon!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.150
Ayukawa!

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.290
Ayukawa!

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:32.140
Ayukawa!

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:35.810
Let's go!

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.860
Dammit!

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:35.920
I'm sorry. I did see the UFO too.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.680
What happened was that...

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:39.040
What really happened was I...

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.470
It's all right now.
What really happened was I...

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:40.540
But, that wouldn't...
It's all right now.

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:41.910
But, that wouldn't...

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:43.340
It's okay now.
But, that wouldn't...

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:43.390
But, that wouldn't...

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:46.330
'Cause, you came for me.

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:51.030
Besides, I don't care what others think about me anyway.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.700
Ayukawa...

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:55.970
It's just that... that what I saw with you, Kasuga...

00:21:55.970 --> 00:21:59.540
...turned out to be only my imagination...

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:02.890
...and that's... kind of sad.

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:10.190
I... I...

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:18.150
I'll get this back to you. Thanks!

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:25.600
Let's go home, Ayukawa.

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:26.850
Yeah.

00:22:35.530 --> 00:22:38.500
Yahoo! Looks like it stopped raining!

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:41.040
Eeek!

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:43.750
What's wrong?

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:45.440
Kurumi, not again!

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:46.640
Bumble, Bumble!
Kurumi, not again!

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:49.680
Then, that's...
Bumble, Bumble!

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:53.050
Really! UFO my ass! Right?

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:55.020
Yeah!
Really! UFO my ass! Right?

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:01.130
OH! Holy... Yuusaku!

00:23:01.130 --> 00:23:02.690
Yes, ma'am!

00:23:21.180 --> 00:23:25.050
Perhaps... the UFO that
we saw that night was also...

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:33.630
I, Kasuga Kyosuke...
in the summer I was fifteen...

00:23:33.630 --> 00:23:37.650
...witnessed a UFO.

00:23:54.980 --> 00:24:02.590
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:02.590 --> 00:24:10.170
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:25.520
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.520 --> 00:24:38.130
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.130 --> 00:24:48.340
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.340 --> 00:24:55.350
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.350 --> 00:25:06.750
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:12.560 --> 00:25:16.700
I don 't wanna do homework
during the coveted summer break!

00:25:16.700 --> 00:25:21.910
But, if Ayukawa invites me to the library to study together, that's different!

00:25:21.910 --> 00:25:27.380
Having said that... I promised Hikaru that I'd go to the pool with her!

00:25:27.380 --> 00:25:31.580
Next time: "The Summer Temptation -
A Double Date Out of the Blue"

00:25:31.580 --> 00:25:35.600
I'm... so thoughtless!
